              "content": {
                "en": "<p>The best evidence we have is one controlled facial trial, appraised on our <a href=\"/pages/copper-peptide-research\">copper peptide research page</a>: 39 of 40 women tolerated a GHK-Cu serum for 8 weeks. If you are unsure whether a change in your skin is a reaction, our <a href=\"/pages/skin-concerns\">skin concerns page</a> is a good place to start.</p>"
