            }
          },
          "short": {
            "type": "richtext",
            "settings": {
              "content": {
                "en": "<p><strong>The short answers on copper uglies:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>What are copper uglies?</strong> An internet term for a rough patch some people describe after starting copper peptides. It is not a measured effect.</li><li><strong>How long do copper uglies last?</strong> Nobody knows. No study has followed anyone through it, so any number you read online is a guess.</li><li><strong>What should you do?</strong> If your skin reacts, stop the product. If the reaction persists, ask a pharmacist or dermatologist. Do not push through it.</li></ul>"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "block_order": ["intro", "short"],
