              "content": {
                "en": "<h2>How long do copper uglies last, and are they reversible?</h2><p>We cannot tell you, and neither can anyone else yet. No study has timed it, so we give no number of days or weeks.</p><p>What we can say is what the trial recorded: the one woman who reacted stopped, and her symptoms settled without medical treatment. That is a single case, not a promise. If a reaction does not fade after you stop, see a pharmacist or dermatologist.</p>"
              }
            }
          }
