            "settings": {
              "content": {
                "en": "<h2>Are GHK-Cu injections the same thing?</h2><p>No. The reactions people discuss after injections are a different use from a cream or serum on the skin. Injections and powders sold online are a different, unregulated use, and nothing in this article is about them. If you are considering them, speak to a doctor.</p>"
